abstract: >-
  A single source-of-truth data model linking Person → Responsibility →
  Project → Task → Deliverable → Evidence → Verification → Completion
  (SQLite + Python, zero-cost stack). Track people, projects, tasks, and
  evidence in a local SQLite database where nothing can be marked
  complete without proof.
